{"id":100068,"date":"2022-08-15T19:20:26","date_gmt":"2022-08-15T12:20:26","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/?p=100068"},"modified":"2022-08-15T19:20:26","modified_gmt":"2022-08-15T12:20:26","slug":"pelantikan-dewan-pengawas-perumda-perkebunan-kahyangan-dan-perumdam-tirta-pandalungan-jember","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/pelantikan-dewan-pengawas-perumda-perkebunan-kahyangan-dan-perumdam-tirta-pandalungan-jember\/","title":{"rendered":"Pelantikan Dewan Pengawas Perumda Perkebunan Kahyangan dan Perumdam Tirta Pandalungan Jember"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-100074 size-full\" src=\"http:\/\/humas.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/IMG_1983-scaled-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" \/><\/p>\n<p>JEMBER, Bupati Jember Ir. H. Hendy Siswanto, ST. IPU melantik 3 orang dewan pengawas atau dewas Perumdam Tirta Pandalungan, dan 3 orang dewan pengawas Perumda Perkebunan Kahyangan pada Senin 15 Agustus 2022.<\/p>\n<p>Mereka yang dilantik di antaranya, Farid Wajdi, Khairil Anwar, dan Ervan Setiawan sebagai Dewas Perumdam Tirta Pandalungan, dan Arief Budiyanto, Luhur Prayoga dan Yanti Budi Hartono sebagai Dewas Perumda Perkebunan Kahyangan.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-100068 gallery-columns-4 gallery-size-full'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/IMG_1958-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/IMG_1958-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/IMG_1965-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"la